   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="address">
            <address>
               <addrLine>
                  <pb facs="MS-SCHNITZLER-B-00043-B-00001-000-00104" />Herrn D<hi rend="superscript">r</hi> Arthur Schnitzler</addrLine>
               <addrLine>
                  <rs ref="#pmb412" type="place">I. Grillparzerstrasse 7</rs>
               </addrLine>
               <addrLine>
                  <rs type="place" ref="#pmb50">Wien</rs>
               </addrLine>
            </address>
         </div>
         <div type="writingSession" n="1">
            <opener>
               <salute>
                  <pb facs="MS-SCHNITZLER-B-00043-B-00001-000-00103" />lieber Arthur!</salute>
            </opener>
            <p>Der arme <anchor type="commentary" xml:id="K_L00271-1" />
               <rs ref="#pmb24651" type="person">Rudolf Schwarzk.</rs>
               <note type="commentary" corresp="K_L00271-1">Die Todesanzeige (<bibl>
                     <rs ref="#pmb29351" type="org">Neue Freie Presse</rs>, Nr. 10.470,
                        <date>15. 10. 1893</date>, S. 14</bibl>.) belegt die Datierung.</note> iſt
               heute früh in <rs ref="#pmb43520" type="place">Meran</rs> geſtorben. <rs ref="#pmb12740" type="person">Guſtav</rs> begräbt ihn dort. <rs ref="#pmb24648" type="person">Max</rs> iſt hier. Es iſt ſehr traurig.</p>
            <closer>
               <signed>Hugo.</signed>
            </closer>
         </div>
      </body>
